{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"baluster-spacing-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"baluster-spacing-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["baluster-spacing-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Kurangkan lebar gabungan balusters dari bukaan yang jelas, kemudian bagi sisa dengan bilangan ruang. Kalkulator ini termasuk ruang yang sama pada kedua-dua hujung, jadi bilangan ruang adalah satu lebih daripada bilangan balusters.","record_id":"421e73f59af60c29e01fc58b3151d3af50ae15e5b78764c2e98ed82aa20b6348","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":0.7774830542500126,"source":"Subtract the combined width of the balusters from the clear opening, then divide the remainder by the number of spaces. This calculator includes an equal space at both ends, so the number of gaps is one more than the number of balusters.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"f6fc5425867b84561219b71d7b1d6b64471f83957aae170a9bbdd13dabcfa31e","status":"needs-review","translation":"Kurangkan lebar gabungan balusters dari bukaan yang jelas, kemudian bagi sisa dengan bilangan ruang. Kalkulator ini termasuk ruang yang sama pada kedua-dua hujung, jadi bilangan ruang adalah satu lebih daripada bilangan balusters.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
